# NAME: Apple Direct
# PURPOSE: Direct-route only region-neutral Apple infrastructure and content delivery.
# ORDER: Place after Apple APNs and Apple Proxy rule sets, before AppleMusic and Apple-AI rule sets.
# SOURCES:
# https://support.apple.com/101555
# https://ruleset.skk.moe/List/domainset/apple_cdn.conf
# https://raw.githubusercontent.com/v2fly/domain-list-community/master/data/itunes
# UPSTREAM PROXY RULE SETS:
# https://raw.githubusercontent.com/blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script/master/rule/Surge/AppleProxy/AppleProxy.list
# https://raw.githubusercontent.com/blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script/master/rule/Surge/AppleMusic/AppleMusic.list
# https://raw.githubusercontent.com/RocM301/Apple-Rule/refs/heads/main/Apple-AI.list

